Z||000025||onfire||04-24-2001||03:54 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by AkursedX:<BR><B>3-3/4"  GI JOE's<BR>The old Star Wars toys<BR>Old Transformer toys<BR>Pez Dispensers<BR>Lots of models (car models mostly)</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>My friend has some Starwars pez dispensers. Very cool.<P>I have a stack of comics. I also collect Fiero stuff and other car stuff. I get a lot of cool stuff from my uncle. He works at firestone. I have a cool Pirelli lighted sign. Some cardboard cutout stuff and a few T-shirts from him. I'm just getting into collecting movie memorabilia. And I keep trying to buy my friends Pepsi machine.<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000026||Formula88||04-24-2001||12:08 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by LZeitgeist:<BR><B>Swords<P>Movie/TV props/replicas<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Yea, what he said.  I collect swords, a few props here and there, and old theater memorbilia (movie posters, reels, poster frames, etc.)  Oh, yea,  and my shot glasses.  Instead of the stupid little spoons, when I travel I get tacky shot glasses from wherever I happen to be.  Still, my favorite have to be the 6oz shot glasses I got a few years back.  They're the same size around as a regular shot glass, but about 6" tall.  Very cool.  <P>Gonna start on my Fiero collection soon (1 doesn't constitue a collection yet).  I figure to get all the Fieros I want I'll need:<BR>Formula - already got it, cuz it's my favorite.<BR>GT - gotta have a fastback in the collection.<BR>Kit car - Probably be a F355, but still up in the air<BR>Race Car - a ragged out coupe that I can gut and turn into a race only Fiero for SCCA, etc!  The Fiero Racing list has infected me!<P>And they all have to be '88s cuz I want the upgraded suspension.  Plus, that way I only have to stock pile parts for one type of suspension, even if they are harder to find.<BR>||||reg||10
